{{bug|dlc=nr|When {{i|Isaac's Tears}} is in the first active item slot, the secondary item does not charge upon clearing rooms.}}
{{Bug|If a player dies in True Co-op in the boss room, and the schoolbag drops an active item, because of the fact that boss item pedestals will spawn as many items as there are players, picking the active item back will spawn additional items up to 3. If the boss pool is gone through, it will start pulling from the treasure room. Once another Active item appears, any other items that could be gained through this method are (likely, needs more testing) unavailable.|dlc=r}}

